From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:01:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: connection point enumerators, localStorage space,
 toStaticHTML, styleMedia, clipboardData, style sheet imports, range
 scroll/help, object form

IConnectionPointContainer::EnumConnectionPoints (an enumerator over the container's points with Next/Skip/Reset/Clone) and
IEnumConnections Skip/Reset/Clone (only live sinks count). localStorage remainingSpace counts the characters of every
name and value against the 5,000,000 character quota of session storage. setTimeout/setInterval take any value as the
text of the script. window.toStaticHTML parses into a detached element and removes script, applet, object, embed and
noscript elements, on* attributes, javascript:/vbscript:/jscript: URLs, style expressions, dynsrc and lowsrc.
window.styleMedia (type "screen", matchMedium over the engine's media queries) and window.clipboardData (Text and URL
on the system clipboard, dropEffect, effectAllowed). IHTMLStyleSheet addImport/removeImport (imports are the leading
rules, indexes are among them) and href. IHTMLTxtRange scrollIntoView and execCommandShowHelp. IHTMLObjectElement form.
IInternetProtocol Abort/Continue/Seek of the about:/res:/javascript: handlers. IHTMLElementCollection enumerator Clone,
IMarkupContainer::OwningDoc of a document, IActiveScriptSite::OnScriptTerminate. variant_to_nsstr converts any variant.
The rest of the mshtml remainder is triaged in the triage file, 58 items escalated (ESCALATE.md).

